/* Pack and receipt artifacts are content-hashed by the signed site manifest,
   so they must never be served stale after a regeneration. HTML pages may
   be cached normally (their bytes are pinned too, and drift shows as
   SITE TAMPER rather than silent staleness). */
/*.zip
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/*.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
